{% endif %}## Install

```sh
curl -fsSLO \
  https://raw.githubusercontent.com/acid-theme/telegram-desktop/main/acid-acetic.tdesktop-palette
```

Open the file with Telegram Desktop, or in Telegram: **Settings → Chat Settings
→ Theme → Edit theme**, then load it.

